# Release installer

A push to `main` or `release/*` builds the NSIS installer and uploads `release/*.exe` as the `w3dts-chessmaster-nsis` artifact. That artifact is the downloadable build.

`pnpm dist` passes `--publish never`. electron-builder must not publish during this job: a missing `GH_TOKEN` fails the build after the exe exists and the artifact is never uploaded.

Do not build the installer on `develop` or on feature branches.
